fixture cam_pogo_shelf
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 3 "Pogo chain"; docs/adr/0011: a pogo bounce is a rest height, so a chain moves the camera along without bobbing it
room test/camera
spawn 2800 2240
frames 240
input
  0..10 R
  11..34 R jump
  35..47 D R
  48..51 D R attack
  52..84 D R
  85..88 D R attack
  89..112 D R
end
expect
  at 11 event.jump=1
  at 50 event.pogo=1
  mark second 53..120 event.pogo=1
  mark land second+1..239 event.land=1
  # Two bounces carry the player over the spikes to the shelf's far end.
  at land y=2240u x>3776u
  during land..239 y=2240u
  never 0..239 event.hazard=1
end
